		{
			dependencies: ["2C871D542E917DD5"]
			description: [
				"Hey you, you're finally awake. "
				""
				"The name is Vladislav Morevsky, leader of The Brotherhood of Nocturnal Labor. We've been eyeing BanksCo awhile, and we think with your help we can finally take the big man out himself. First we'll have to get you used to your new form. How about going up to some creature and sucking their blood? Normal food is no longer of use to people like us."
			]
			id: "7E07A1497FEAD986"
			rewards: [{
				exclude_from_claim_all: true
