		{
			dependencies: ["46CC383D89DAA430"]
			description: ["Right now you're just a baby vampire, with the Altar Of Inspiration you can infuse yourself with blood to become even more powerful. Simply fill it with blood bottles, and once full sneak right click with an empty hand to infuse yourself."]
