		{
			dependencies: ["09966F96BAD9522A"]
			description: [
				"Once you level up a bit you'll notice that you no longer have enough space in the previous altar. You now have to build a even grander altar. This altar needs to be surrounded by pillars (filled with a block) 2 or 3 blocks high topped off with an altar tip in a 9x9 area. Each new level requires a higher \"structure point\" amount."
				""
				"Stone pillar = 1pt"
				"Bone pillar = 1.5pt"
				"Iron pillar = 2pt"
				"Gold pillar = 3pt"
				""
				"You will also need vampire books, which can be found all around the world in chests."
