			dependencies: ["3C4E214564C1E942"]
			description: [
				"As you can see currently, most villages around the world are corrupt with the ideals of capitalism and anti-vampire thinking. If a village doesn't have one of these already, you can build a village totem and right click it to spread our cause. This totem will also allow a representative to spawn and give out quests."
